      (∀ Φ ∈ GlobalTheory.WeilM.schA D.host.F (Fin m × Fin k), T Φ = GlobalTheory.TripleRead.thO Mo ψ G e Φ) ∧
      ∀ Φ ∈ GlobalTheory.WeilM.schA D.host.F (Fin m × Fin k), T Φ = 0 → Φ = 0 := by
